There is also a short-handif...else, known as theternary operatorbecause it uses three operands.

The ternary operatorreturns a valuebased on a condition: if the condition istrue, it returns the first value; otherwise, it returns the second value.

It can be used to replace multiple lines of code with a single line, and is often used to replace simpleif...elsestatements:

